{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scam Line \u2014 a party game for 4\u20138 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/c547de02afddd0a300774c090fd460b8.poster.avif?t=1764514912\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/c547de02afddd0a300774c090fd460b8.webm?t=1764514912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/c547de02afddd0a300774c090fd460b8.mp4?t=1764514912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Only one will win</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players are split into rooms, and the only way to communicate is an old mobile handset.<br>You\u2019ll face a series of social challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn your neighbours\u2019 room number before anyone else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot who among you is dressed differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the classic Prisoner\u2019s Dilemma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and many more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/1ae3e52c1b82a3a3b6ededcad9ba68b6.poster.avif?t=1764514912\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/1ae3e52c1b82a3a3b6ededcad9ba68b6.webm?t=1764514912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/1ae3e52c1b82a3a3b6ededcad9ba68b6.mp4?t=1764514912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your style of play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make deals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do the opposite</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bluff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manipulate</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/57111ef862dfe5a29adf8c6e3e68888d.poster.avif?t=1764514912\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/57111ef862dfe5a29adf8c6e3e68888d.webm?t=1764514912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/57111ef862dfe5a29adf8c6e3e68888d.mp4?t=1764514912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much will the game cost?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the price of a cup of coffee.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are new friendslops released every day \u2014 why play this one?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because while clones pop up all the time, Scam Line delivers a genuinely unique social experience built around deception, timing and environmental surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it run on my potato PC?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there bugs?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2794590?t=1764514912","background_r